---
// src/components/AboutSection.astro
// Clean, informative About section highlighting engineering discipline & background
---

<section id="about" class="section-padding about-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">
        <span class="lang-id">Tentang Saya</span>
        <span class="lang-en hidden">About Me</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        <span class="lang-id">Dedikasi Pada Keandalan Sistem & Rekayasa Web</span>
        <span class="lang-en hidden">Dedicated to System Reliability & Modern Web Engineering</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        <span class="lang-id">
          Menggabungkan ketelitian konfigurasi jaringan fisik enterprise dengan fleksibilitas pengembangan aplikasi berbasis cloud modern.
        </span>
        <span class="lang-en hidden">
          Bridging the rigor of enterprise physical network administration with the agility of modern cloud application development.
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Main Narrative Card -->
      <div class="editorial-card narrative-card">
        <h3 class="narrative-heading">
          <span class="lang-id">Profil & Latar Belakang</span>
          <span class="lang-en hidden">Background & Discipline</span>
        </h3>
        
        <p class="narrative-text">
          <span class="lang-id">
            Saya adalah siswa SMK bidang <strong>Teknik Komputer & Jaringan (TKJ)</strong> dengan reputasi kompetitif di bidang <em>IT Network System Administration</em>. Berhasil meraih <strong>Juara 1 LKS Tingkat Kabupaten Purworejo 2026</strong> dan mewakili daerah pada <strong>LKS Provinsi Jawa Tengah ke-XXXIV</strong>.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-en hidden">
            I am a vocational high school student in <strong>Computer & Network Engineering</strong> with a competitive track record in <em>IT Network System Administration</em>. Secured <strong>1st Place in the 2026 Purworejo Regency LKS</strong> and represented the region at the <strong>34th Central Java Provincial LKS</strong>.
          </span>
        </p>

        <p class="narrative-text">
          <span class="lang-id">
            Di luar ranah jaringan fisik dan administrasi server Linux/Windows, saya aktif merancang platform web produksi publik — seperti sistem pelaporan terintegrasi triase AI <strong>PERISAI</strong> dan <strong>PERISAI AYOM</strong> untuk instansi pemerintahan Kapanewon Temon. Pendekatan saya berlandaskan prinsip: arsitektur bersih, keamanan ketat, performa tinggi, dan tanpa kompromi pada kualitas.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-en hidden">
            Beyond physical networking and Linux/Windows server administration, I actively build production web systems — such as the AI-triaged public reporting platforms <strong>PERISAI</strong> and <strong>PERISAI AYOM</strong> for Kapanewon Temon local government. My engineering approach centers on clean architectures, strict security, blazing speed, and zero compromise on quality.
          </span>
        </p>

        <div class="narrative-footer">
          <div class="identity-badge">
            <span class="badge-label">
              <span class="lang-id">Sekolah:</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Alma Mater:</span>
            </span>
            <span class="badge-val">SMK Patriot Pituruh</span>
          </div>
          <div class="identity-badge">
            <span class="badge-label">
              <span class="lang-id">Kompetensi:</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Specialization:</span>
            </span>
            <span class="badge-val">Teknik Komputer & Jaringan (TKJ)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Key Pillars Column -->
      <div class="pillars-col">
        <div class="editorial-card pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon">🌐</div>
          <div class="pillar-content">
            <h4>
              <span class="lang-id">Jaringan Enterprise & Routing</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Enterprise Networking & Routing</span>
            </h4>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-id">Desain topologi multi-lantai, VLAN segmentation, MikroTik firewall NAT, QoS bandwidth management, dan routing dinamis Cisco.</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Multi-floor topology design, VLAN segmentation, MikroTik firewall NAT, QoS bandwidth control, and dynamic Cisco routing.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="editorial-card pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon">🐧</div>
          <div class="pillar-content">
            <h4>
              <span class="lang-id">Server Linux & Infrastruktur</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Linux Servers & Infrastructure</span>
            </h4>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-id">Penerapan Debian 12 / Ubuntu Server, Windows Server 2022 ADDS, DNS BIND9, Nginx reverse proxy, dan sistem virtualisasi Proxmox.</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Deploying Debian 12 / Ubuntu Server, Windows Server 2022 ADDS, BIND9 DNS, Nginx reverse proxy, and Proxmox virtualization.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="editorial-card pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon">⚡</div>
          <div class="pillar-content">
            <h4>
              <span class="lang-id">Pengembangan Web & Edge Cloud</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Modern Web & Edge Cloud</span>
            </h4>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-id">Membangun antarmuka ultra-cepat dengan Astro 5, React, Next.js, database terisolasi Cloudflare D1 / Supabase PostgreSQL, dan triase AI Gemini.</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Building high-speed web apps with Astro 5, React, Next.js, Cloudflare D1 / Supabase PostgreSQL, and Gemini Flash AI triage.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
  }

  .narrative-card {
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 36px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .narrative-heading {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .narrative-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .narrative-text strong {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .narrative-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .identity-badge {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  .badge-label {
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .badge-val {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .pillars-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    line-height: 1;
    padding: 10px;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .pillar-content h4 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .pillar-content p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
